<title>USA: Pete's Brewing names Atkins CFO.</title>
<headline>Pete's Brewing names Atkins CFO.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pete's Brewing Co Tuesday named Jeffrey Atkins, vice president, strategic planning of Quaker Oats Co, to the post of chief financial officer, effective December 16.</p>
<p>In a statement, Pete's said current Chief Financial Officer Jim Collins will move into a newly created position as vice president of brewery development.</p>
